{"sourceUrl":"http://www.ms.ynu.edu.cn/info/1040/2161.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:05.888587+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.ms.ynu.edu.cn/info/1040/2161.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span> 一、学院简介</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>云南大学数学与统计学院成立于</span></span><span>2005</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>12</span><span><span>月，她的前身数学系创建于</span></span><span>1934</span><span><span>年，统计系创建于</span></span><span>1989</span><span><span>年，是中国大学历史悠久的数学系和统计系之一。多年来，在学校的关心和支持下，在学院全体师生的共同努力下，学院现已发展成为一个集教学、科研和社会服务于一体的研究教学型学院。数学与统计学院现已形成一支以中青年教师为核心，职称、年龄、学历和专业结构合理的、优势明显的师资队伍。学院拥有数学、统计学</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>个博士后科研流动站；数学、统计学</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>个一级学科博士学位授权点；数学、统计学</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>个一级学科硕士学位授权点，下设基础数学、应用数学、计算数学、运筹学与控制论、概率论与数理统计、统计学、社会经济统计、应用统计和大数据统计</span>9<span>个二级学科专业；还拥有数量经济学硕士学位授权点和应用统计硕士专业学位授权点，形成了完整的本</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>硕</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>博，专业硕士以及博士后的人才培养体系。学院为社会培养了大批具有潜力的数学、统计工作者，更有一些已经成为知名学者、教授或博士生导师以及各级领导或专家。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、夏令营时间安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>、夏令营申请截止日期：</span></span><span>2025</span><span><span>年</span>7<span>月</span></span><span>16</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>16</span><span><span>点</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>、夏令营安排：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2025</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>19</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>08:30-17:30</span><span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院情况介绍和宣讲、交流会、专家讲座（线上）</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2025</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>20</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>08:30-17:30</span><span><span>：综合面试及优秀营员选拔、结营仪式（线上）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、申请资格</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请我院</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>优秀大学生夏令营</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>的学生应具备以下条件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>、具有坚定的社会主义理想信念，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好，诚实守信，学风端正，身心健康，申请者原则上为</span></span><span><span>本科</span>202</span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>级（预计</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>6<span>月毕业）有志攻读硕士研究生的在校大学</span></span><span><span>生</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>、学习成绩优异，原则上本科前三年总评成绩排名在班级前</span></span><span>30%</span><span><span>，或者虽然成绩不在班级排名的前</span></span><span>30%</span><span><span>，但在其他方面有优异表现者，如有相关科研成果（需提供相关材料复印件）等亦可申请；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>对所报专业领域的科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，有较强的科研潜力。外语水平良好</span></span><span><span>，原则上英语四级成绩达到</span></span><span>425</span><span><span>分以上（含</span></span><span>425</span><span><span>分）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4<span>、有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的科研能力和创新能力。</span></span><span><span>品德良好、遵纪守法、诚实守信、身心健康</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、申请材料</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>、</span></span><span>2025</span><span><span>年云南大学全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>、最新本科阶段成绩单</span></span><span>(</span><span><span>需</span></span><span><span>加盖</span></span><span><span>所在本科院</span>(<span>校</span><span>)</span></span><span><span>教务处公章</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span><span>、成绩排名证明</span></span><span>(<span>加盖</span></span><span><span>所在本科院</span>(<span>校</span><span>)</span></span><span><span>教务处公章</span>)</span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span><span>、国家英语四级、六级或其他英语能力资格证书</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5</span><span><span>、其他证明材料</span></span><span>(</span><span><span>如已发表论文、各类获奖或资格证书等</span></span><span>)</span></p>\n<p><span><span>以上材料需按顺序扫描成一个</span>pdf<span>文件，以</span><span>“2025</span><span>夏令营</span><span>_</span><span>姓名</span><span>_</span><span>申请专业</span><span>_</span><span>本科学校</span><span>”</span><span>命名</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、申请方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>所有申请学生需于</span></span><span>2025</span><span><span>年</span>7<span>月</span></span><span>16</span><span><span>日前将申请材料（扫描成一个</span>pdf<span>并按要求命名），发送到</span></span><span>1615986575@qq.com (</span><span><span>报考数学类专业</span></span><span>)</span><span><span>或</span></span><span>3378845100@qq.com (</span><span><span>报考统计学专业，含专硕</span></span><span>)</span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>无需邮寄纸质版申请材料。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>、考核评优</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>、我院将根据营员申请材料及在营期间</span></span><span><span>等</span></span><span><span>表现</span></span><span><span>情况</span></span><span><span>，选拔出优秀营员，颁发优秀营员证书。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>七</span></span><span><span>、联系我们</span></span></p>\n<p><span>QQ<span>群</span><span>:</span></span> <span>132499196 </span> <span>(</span><span><span>数学相关专业</span></span><span>)</span></p>\n<p><span>QQ<span>群</span><span>:</span></span> <span>1056425089</span> <span>(</span><span><span>统计学相关专业，含专硕</span></span><span>)</span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电话：</span></span><span>0871-65033700</span></p>\n<p><span><span>八</span></span><span><span>、注意事项</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>．若发现申请材料有虚假成分，则取消申请人一切由此获得的权益，并保留相关追溯权。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>．入选营员要求全程参加夏令营活动，遵守云南大学以及各举办单位的相关规定。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>附件下载：<a href=\"http://www.ms.ynu.edu.cn/fujian4.yunnandaxuequanguoyouxiudaxueshengxialingyingshenqingbiao.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"云南大学全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表\">云南大学全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表</a> </span></span></p>\n<p><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><span><span>数学与统计学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2025</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"052f162add8a55849b877baaeff19b986a79e2ebdff43f78eeec82f4f93708cd","textLength":1417,"sourceSha256":"3efa7d588cbf6f502af96d062d35049bb9d14371dfc2bec264a0d50218f55f70","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-114e055e7f204bff97e0","title":"2025年云南大学数学与统计学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营招生实施方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:05.888587+00:00"}
